Third-party material
--------------------

Vendor brand marks on agent rows are drawn from path data published under
CC0-1.0: most from the simple-icons project (https://simpleicons.org), which
is a declared dependency, and OpenAI's mark from Gil Barbara's SVG Logos
(https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos), whose collection is too large to depend
on for a single icon and whose path is therefore inlined in
apps/desktop/src/lib/brandMarks.ts with its source recorded alongside it.

These marks remain the trademarks of their respective owners. They appear
nominatively — to identify which tool produced a session — and imply no
affiliation with or endorsement by those owners.
